Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Ordered Topology Inventory Digest Reconciliation Data Design

Description: Unsigned Data-Driven Design quality-gate record for the pure supplied digest reconciliation. It defines data identity, ownership, relations, cardinality, transforms, lifecycle, physical representation, and provenance before canonical authority.

